# Source — npm configuration
#
# Pin policy: every dependency installed via `npm install <pkg>` is
# saved with an exact version (no `^` / `~` prefix). This makes
# package.json the source of truth for the dependency graph and
# prevents silent transitive bumps.
#
# Engine policy: refuse to install when the current Node version is
# outside the `engines` range declared in package.json. This catches
# Node-version drift between local dev and CI early.
#
# See: sites/source/docs/SUPPLY_CHAIN.md § Dependency pin policy.

save-exact=true
engine-strict=true
